1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:08,000
Welcome to MësoLehtë AI, a digital platform that helps teachers adapt learning materials to each student's needs.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,500
The homepage provides a brief introduction to the platform's functions for both teachers and students.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:21,000
To begin, we open the login page and select the appropriate role.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,500
First, we sign in as an administrator using the email address and password that will be securely provided to the school.

5
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:35,500
The administrator dashboard summarizes activity and provides access to the Administration area.

6
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:43,500
Here, the administrator can create a teacher invitation by entering the teacher's email address.

7
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:50,500
A unique invitation code is generated, copied, and sent only to the intended teacher.

8
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:59,500
The teacher registers by entering their name, email address, password, and invitation code.

9
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:08,500
After registration, the account is automatically linked to the school and the teacher can access their dashboard.

10
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:33,500
From the teacher dashboard, we open the Classes section.

11
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:40,500
Teachers can create and manage classes and add students to the appropriate class.

12
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:48,000
A student account can also be created directly by the teacher.

13
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:58,000
The teacher enters the student's name, email, temporary password, age, learning level, and class.

14
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:03,500
These credentials should be shared privately with the student.

15
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:10,000
Next, we create a new learning material.

16
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:18,000
The platform accepts typed text, text files, or PDF documents.

17
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:29,000
We select the document, class, students, adaptation level, and AI features such as summaries, vocabulary, quizzes, audio, and visuals.

18
00:02:30,633 --> 00:02:38,000
After processing, the teacher reviews the material generated by artificial intelligence.

19
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:46,000
The content and questions can be checked or regenerated before approval.

20
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:53,217
Only after teacher approval is the material published to the selected students and shown in the materials list.

21
00:03:01,766 --> 00:03:09,000
The Analytics section gives teachers an overview of results, progress, and audio usage.

22
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Under Stars and Titles, teachers can motivate students by awarding bonus stars and adding a short reason.

23
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Accessibility settings include language, font, text size, line spacing, contrast, dark mode, and reduced animation.

24
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:31,500
The same accessibility controls can also be opened quickly from the sidebar icon.

25
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:37,262
The notification icon shows recent updates about materials and student results.

26
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:55,500
Students can access the platform in two different ways.

27
00:03:55,500 --> 00:04:04,000
The first is self-registration using a class code provided by the teacher.

28
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:14,000
The student selects the Student role and enters their name, email address, password, and class code.

29
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:20,500
The new account is automatically connected to the correct class.

30
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:29,500
The second option is to use an account that the teacher has already created.

31
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:39,000
The student signs in with the email address and temporary password received from the teacher.

32
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:46,000
After signing in, the student can see all published materials assigned to them.

33
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:54,000
The student opens a material and works through the adapted text, vocabulary, and exercises.

34
00:04:54,000 --> 00:05:02,000
Albanian audio allows the student to listen to the content and makes the material more accessible.

35
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:08,000
During the quiz, the student selects answers and receives immediate feedback, explanations, and supporting illustrations.

36
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:13,000
When the quiz is complete, the system prepares a learning report.

37
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:17,000
The waiting period shown here has been accelerated for this demonstration.

38
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:22,000
The report summarizes the result, duration, audio usage, difficulties, and recommendations.

39
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:26,000
The report is also sent to the teacher so that the next steps can reflect the student's actual performance.

40
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:28,500
Students can view their bonus stars, change accessibility preferences, and check their notifications.

41
00:05:28,500 --> 00:05:31,000
MësoLehtë AI combines school-controlled administration, practical teacher tools, and accessible personalized learning for students.
